      "title": "Gv Films Limited Announces Appointment of Himanshu Keshubhai Togadia as Additional Director and Committees Member",
      "body": "GV Films Limited that the meeting of Board of Directors of the Company held i.e., 09th January 2026 at 11.30 a.m. at Company's Registered Office at Gala No B 14 B 1st Floor Pravasi Industrial Estate, Goregaon Mulund Link Road, Goregaon East, Mumbai - 400063 have inter alia considered and approved: Appointed Mr. HIMANSHU KESHUBHAI TOGADIYA (Din: 07610961) as an Additional Director (Independent) of the Company (Brief Profile): CS Himanshu Togadiya is a Fellow member of the Institute of Company Secretaries of India. He possesses over 9 years of experience in the fields of handling compliances under various Corporate Laws, listing agreement; for Initial Public Issues, Rights Issues, Bonus Issues, Preferential Allotments, QIPs, Takeover of Listed & unlisted companies, etc. CS Himanshu Togadiya ",
